# The short GIF on tags: tag a picture from the menu, then look at the list of that colour.
Source docs/tapes/ambiente.tape
Output docs/media/tag.gif
Set Framerate 15
Type "rada --icons nerd --images halfblocks --demo main ~/projects/demo"
Enter
Sleep 1500ms
Show
Sleep 800ms
Down 13
Sleep 1s
Ctrl+K
Sleep 1200ms
Down 10
Sleep 600ms
Enter
Sleep 1200ms
Down 3
Sleep 600ms
Enter
Sleep 1800ms
Enter
Sleep 2500ms
Tab
Down 13
Sleep 600ms
Enter
Sleep 2500ms
